{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1247.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"0ef4be87ce1032a5f108ed0a547bf903e40552732a21c60c74fe248c70ae9e50","ja":"そして、音楽番組の収録当日……","zh":"然后，到了音乐节目录制当天……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1247.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"57f50927fa3d90e5eed397e6dfbf378e6a0833494ebdef7fd5db3f882c7fbcd2","ja":"「……では最後の質問です！　今食べたいものは\n和菓子と洋菓子、ずばりどっち？」","zh":"“……那么最后一个问题！现在想吃的东西，\n日式点心和西式点心，到底选哪个？”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1247.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0e5c0bb15a902a468cd16e23f109fb04b4b3a865b2ec29431bc82345f63ad2e7","ja":"私は『洋菓子』でしょうか。\nふわふわのフィナンシェが食べたい気分です♪","zh":"我选“西式点心”吧。\n好想吃松软的费南雪♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1247.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"827d314e525032db889892962fa8e1dcbed509787329c356886df39ecc4b56f4","ja":"私は『和菓子』です。\nあんこはいつ食べても良いものですから♪","zh":"我选“日式点心”。\n因为红豆馅无论什么时候吃都很棒呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1247.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"ea0ff3bdd9ad00e1757e817b068625039dd2fa87f8aedced6853a4d57c8772f4","ja":"ふふ、結局最後までバラバラの回答に\nなってしまいましたね。","zh":"呵呵，结果到最后大家的回答\n也完全不一样呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1247.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"d70b5330d5db854f3e7cb299d889c96229b73227b2a508804d5a64d290ddcda1","ja":"はい、ですが……そんな私たちにも、\n息ぴったりなときがあります。","zh":"是的，不过……就算是这样的我们，\n也是有配合默契的时候的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1247.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"4238237909571eacc2d43ce5f18b851b2f0160651cfc5302859bdd194e631743","ja":"それは……ふたりで歌う瞬間です！","zh":"那就是……两个人一起歌唱的瞬间！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1247.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"62905e6628f016764c537f44a2838bc6e272f842c61c714e026140a92f69c0ec","ja":"この間、桜守さんと一緒にお出かけしたときに、\n桜守さんから教えていただきました。","zh":"前阵子和樱守小姐一起外出时，\n承蒙樱守小姐教了我呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1247.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"89861256fd326f29340d4022d242bae6bd91dd98374bb0160c8a3e03c3db861b","ja":"お互いの声に耳を傾けて\n呼吸を合わせる……。","zh":"倾听彼此的声音，\n调整彼此的呼吸……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1247.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"e56bbfb23d5dea50ba7fc6a33aeb63cf8e8c77c82cf5980789f4f33e5c0fec3d","ja":"そして個性が違うふたりが、お互いの良さを\n高め合ってひとつの歌を紡ぐ……それが私たちです。","zh":"个性迥异的两人相互衬托、\n彼此成就，编织出一首歌曲……这就是我们。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1247.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"32a844173b5dc1f340aabd1572da29e2a223f602d9f292a83517b24d0a9aef63","ja":"それでは今から、その息ぴったりのハーモニーを\nみなさんにお届けいたします。","zh":"那么现在，就为大家献上\n她们那配合默契的和声。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1247.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"ed8b38356ddaaaee24a3d01c0cf14249368f091bbbf147157a9ffb2e574acd26","ja":"私たちの歌、どうぞお聞きください♪","zh":"请欣赏我们的歌曲♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:33:45+00:00"}
